from ground_author import *
source('crossrail-passages','Crossrail：聯絡通道施工方法與地質','Crossrail: Cross passages, construction methods and geology','Crossrail Ltd','https://learninglegacy.crossrail.co.uk/documents/cross-passages-construction-methods-geology/','官方資料列十九處聯絡通道，明說沒有採用地盤凍結；本課用於排水與凍結之方案比較，不當凍結實績。','Official dataset lists nineteen cross passages and explicitly says ground freezing was not adopted; used for drainage-versus-freezing comparison, not as a freezing project.')
add('b179','凍結壁閉合、地下水熱輸送與融沉控制~Frozen-wall closure, groundwater heat transport and thaw settlement','人工地盤凍結透過冷卻與相變暫時增加地層強度並減少滲流，卻同時引入熱量、凍脹及解凍變形問題。本課將凍結管幾何、對流熱輸送、長期潛變與備援冷量分開檢查，再建立從臨時凍土支護轉交永久襯砌的證據與停留點。~Artificial ground freezing temporarily strengthens ground and restricts seepage through cooling and phase change, while introducing thermal, heave and thaw-deformation concerns. The course separately examines pipe geometry, advective heat, creep and cooling reserves, then builds evidence and hold points for transferring support from frozen soil to the permanent lining.',compact(r'''
相變熱量~Latent heat || 凍結不只是把溫度降到零度以下，孔隙水由液態轉成冰還需移除潛熱。含水量、鹽分及未凍水比例決定熱量與強度的關係；測得局部低溫不代表整個目標體積已形成連續、足夠厚且可承載的凍土體。~Freezing requires more than lowering temperature below zero: converting pore water to ice also removes latent heat. Water content, salinity and unfrozen water govern the relation between heat and strength. A cold local reading does not establish a continuous frozen body with adequate thickness and resistance throughout the target volume. || 假設需要相變的水質量m=1000 kg、潛熱Lf=334 kJ/kg，Q=mLf=334000 kJ~For water mass m=1000 kg undergoing phase change and latent heat Lf=334 kJ/kg, Q=mLf=334000 kJ || 以取樣含水量、鹽分及溫度曲線建立焓模型，核對熱量移除紀錄與凍結範圍。~Build an enthalpy model from sampled water content, salinity and temperature curves, comparing extracted heat with inferred freezing extent. || 忽略潛熱會低估冷量需求，造成局部低溫卻遲遲不能形成完整凍結壁。~Ignoring latent heat underestimates cooling demand, giving cold local readings without completion of the frozen barrier. || 溫度低於零度就表示所有孔隙水已全部結冰。~A temperature below zero means all pore water is frozen. || 材料試驗需保留土種、含鹽量與未凍水假設；冷凍及地工設計者共同確認熱模型後才設定閉合判據。~Retain soil type, salinity and unfrozen-water assumptions in testing; refrigeration and geotechnical designers jointly confirm the thermal model before closure criteria are set. || 此式只計相變潛熱，未含土粒顯熱、管路損失及流動地下水帶入熱量，因此不能直接用來決定實際凍結工期或設備容量。~This expression includes latent heat only, excluding soil sensible heat, pipe losses and heat carried by flowing groundwater; it cannot directly determine field freezing duration or plant capacity.
凍結管交疊~Freeze-pipe overlap || 相鄰凍結管周圍的低溫區需連成完整屏障，管距及鑽孔偏斜決定最薄弱的中間位置。均勻圓形凍結半徑只是簡化，地下水流會使凍土範圍不對稱；井內靠近管壁的低溫因此不能替代管間最暖點的閉合證據。~Cold zones around adjacent pipes must join into a continuous barrier, with spacing and drilling deviation governing the weakest midpoint. Circular uniform freezing radii are an idealization; groundwater flow makes the frozen body asymmetric. Low temperatures near pipe walls therefore cannot replace closure evidence at the warmest positions between pipes. || 假設兩管中心距s=1.2 m、各凍結半徑r=0.65 m，幾何間隙g=s−2r=−0.10 m，表示重疊0.10 m~For spacing s=1.2 m and equal freezing radius r=0.65 m, gap g=s−2r=−0.10 m, indicating 0.10 m geometric overlap || 量測鑽孔軌跡並在預測最暖區配置測溫孔，對照三維等溫面與實際管位。~Measure bore trajectories and locate temperature holes in predicted warm zones, comparing three-dimensional isotherms with actual pipe positions. || 管位偏差可能留下狹窄未凍通道，平均溫度合格仍會在開口時產生集中湧水。~Pipe deviation can leave a narrow unfrozen channel that admits concentrated inflow despite an acceptable mean temperature. || 所有凍結管出水都很冷就代表凍土壁已閉合。~Cold return fluid from every pipe proves closure of the frozen wall. || 管位偏差圖與測溫孔應共同驗收；開挖放行由設計者依最不利連續路徑判定，不以平均低溫取代。~Accept pipe deviations and temperature-hole positions together; the designer releases excavation from the most adverse continuous path, not from average cold readings. || 幾何交疊只是理想等半徑判斷，沒有證明溫度、強度或水密；鹽分和地下水對流可能使實際閉合時間大幅不同。~Geometric overlap assumes equal ideal radii and proves neither temperature, strength nor sealing; salinity and groundwater advection can substantially alter actual closure time.
對流熱輸送~Advective heat || 流動地下水會持續把熱量帶進凍結區，可能使凍結壁迎水側與背水側形成不同厚度。熱輸送取決於水量與溫差，不只取決於土壤導熱係數；若地下水通道集中在薄砂層，整體平均滲透係數可能低估局部熱障礙。~Flowing groundwater continuously brings heat into the freezing zone and can produce different upstream and downstream thicknesses. Heat transport depends on discharge and temperature difference as well as conductivity. Concentrated flow in a thin sand layer may create a local thermal obstacle that an average ground permeability fails to represent. || 水密度ρ=1000 kg/m³、比熱c=4.18 kJ/(kg·K)、流量q=0.001 m³/s、降溫ΔT=10 K，P=ρcqΔT=41.8 kW~For ρ=1000 kg/m³, c=4.18 kJ/(kg·K), q=0.001 m³/s and ΔT=10 K, P=ρcqΔT=41.8 kW || 使用分層水壓與抽水試驗推估流向，對照測溫面是否沿含水層偏移，核對熱平衡殘差。~Infer flow direction from multilevel pressures and hydraulic tests, compare thermal-front displacement along aquifers, and examine heat-balance residuals. || 局部高速水流可能維持未凍通道，若只增加冷卻時間而不查熱源，閉合可能始終無法完成。~A local high-flow path may remain unfrozen; simply extending cooling without identifying the heat source may never achieve closure. || 只要冷凍機持續運轉，任何地下水流量都能自然克服。~Continuous refrigeration can automatically overcome any groundwater flow rate. || 熱水力模型應分列集中流路與平均流場；異常暖區需由冷凍及水文設計者共同解釋，才可改變開挖時程。~Separate concentrated flow paths from the average field in the thermal-hydraulic model; refrigeration and hydrogeological designers explain warm anomalies before excavation timing changes. || 算例為水流顯熱負荷，未含相變與導熱；流量本身會隨凍結堵塞而變化，不能假設整個過程維持固定熱輸入。~This is an advective sensible-heat load, excluding phase change and conduction; discharge itself changes as freezing restricts flow, so heat input need not remain constant throughout.
熱擴散尺度~Thermal diffusion scale || 溫度擾動向土體內傳遞需要時間，傳遞距離加倍時，純擴散的代表時間約增為四倍。這個尺度幫助辨識管距敏感度，卻沒有包含冰水相變與地下水對流；不能把擴散時間直接當成凍結壁已滿足開挖條件的時刻。~Temperature changes take time to propagate through soil, and doubling distance approximately quadruples a pure-diffusion time scale. This helps identify spacing sensitivity but excludes phase change and groundwater advection. The diffusion time cannot therefore be treated as the instant when a frozen wall satisfies excavation requirements. || 傳熱距離L=0.5 m、熱擴散率α=1×10⁻⁶ m²/s，t*=L²/α=250000 s=2.89 day~For thermal length L=0.5 m and diffusivity α=1×10⁻⁶ m²/s, t*=L²/α=250000 s=2.89 day || 以不同距離測溫孔比較反應延遲，檢查純導熱模型是否系統性低估最暖點的降溫時間。~Compare thermal response delays at different distances and check whether conduction-only analysis systematically underestimates cooling time at the warmest point. || 把擴散尺度當成完工工期會提前開挖，凍結壁可能仍有薄弱區或未達所需低溫強度。~Treating a diffusion scale as completion time can release excavation while the wall remains locally thin or lacks the required low-temperature strength. || 公式算出三天就保證三天後所有凍土都能承載。~A three-day diffusion calculation guarantees load-bearing frozen soil after three days. || 計畫中分開標示熱尺度、預測閉合時間與驗收停留點；開挖決策須由設計者依實測連續溫度場核准。~Distinguish thermal scale, predicted closure and acceptance hold point in the plan; the designer approves excavation from the measured continuous temperature field. || 這是量綱一致的擴散估算，不是史蒂芬相變問題的完整解；材料溫度依存性與鹽水凍結區間仍須另外處理。~This is a dimensionally consistent diffusion estimate, not a full Stefan phase-change solution; temperature-dependent properties and a saline freezing interval require separate treatment.
凍土潛變~Frozen-soil creep || 凍土的承載不只由瞬間抗壓強度決定，溫度接近融點或長時間受力時會發生潛變。交叉通道開挖改變凍結壁的形狀及受力路徑，永久襯砌未閉合前的暴露時間因此直接影響變形需求，必須用相應溫度與持續時間評估。~Frozen-soil resistance depends on more than instantaneous compressive strength because creep develops under sustained load, especially near thawing. Cross-passage excavation changes frozen-wall geometry and load paths. Exposure before permanent lining closure therefore directly affects deformation demand and must be evaluated at the relevant temperature and loading duration. || 假設凍土受壓力N=1200 kN、有效面積A=4 m²，平均σ=N/A=300 kPa~For frozen-ground compression N=1200 kN over effective area A=4 m², mean σ=N/A=300 kPa || 在代表溫度下做持續載重材料試驗，配合洞內收斂與溫度資料，檢查變形速率是否加速。~Run sustained-load material tests at representative temperatures and compare convergence and temperature records for accelerating deformation rates. || 低溫試體的短期強度若誤用於較暖且長期受壓區，可能出現逐步收斂及支護超載。~Applying cold-specimen short-term strength to warmer, sustained-loading zones may lead to progressive convergence and overloaded support. || 凍土短期抗壓試驗合格就不需要考慮施工等待時間。~Passing a short-term frozen-soil compression test makes waiting time irrelevant. || 排程應把凍結支護使用時間與襯砌閉合時間連結；延誤時由地工設計者重新評估潛變與維持冷量。~Link frozen-support duration to lining closure in the programme; delays require the geotechnical designer to reassess creep and sustained cooling demand. || 平均應力不代表凍土容許應力，局部拉應力與剪應力也可能控制；設計材料參數必須對應實際溫度範圍與時間尺度。~Mean stress is not an allowable frozen-soil stress, and local tension or shear may govern; design properties must correspond to the actual temperature range and time scale.
凍結壁滲流~Frozen-wall seepage || 冰填充孔隙後滲透性會下降，但未凍水、砂層與管間缺口仍可能形成連通通道。達西流量可描述理想均質屏障的量級，實際水密控制往往由最薄弱路徑主導；觀察少量出水也應檢查它是否攜砂及是否隨時間增大。~Ice reduces pore connectivity, but unfrozen water, sand seams and pipe gaps can preserve connected pathways. Darcy flow gives the scale for an ideal homogeneous barrier, whereas actual sealing is often controlled by the weakest path. Even small inflow requires checks for transported sediment and increasing discharge with time. || 假設k=1×10⁻⁸ m/s、滲流面積A=20 m²、水力坡降i=5，Q=kAi=1×10⁻⁶ m³/s~For k=1×10⁻⁸ m/s, seepage area A=20 m² and gradient i=5, Q=kAi=1×10⁻⁶ m³/s || 比對水壓差與分區集水量，檢查溫度異常及混濁度，將滲流位置與實際凍結管軌跡疊圖。~Compare pressure difference and zoned collection flows, check temperature anomalies and turbidity, and overlay seepage locations on actual pipe trajectories. || 未凍通道可能在開挖卸壓後擴大，湧水攜砂會使凍結壁局部侵蝕並改變支護形狀。~An unfrozen path can enlarge after excavation pressure release; sediment-carrying inflow may erode the frozen wall and change its support geometry. || 凍結後的土體可以永遠視為絕對不透水。~Frozen ground can always be treated as completely impermeable. || 開挖前的水密驗證須使用核定方法且控制擾動；地工與水文負責人共同確認異常出水的停止條件。~Use an approved, disturbance-controlled sealing verification before excavation; geotechnical and hydrogeological leads jointly define stop conditions for anomalous inflow. || 達西模型假設層流與代表性滲透係數，無法描述開裂集中流；本式的低流量不能取代整體凍結壁連續性證據。~Darcy modelling assumes laminar flow and representative permeability and does not describe concentrated fracture flow; this small calculated discharge cannot replace evidence of barrier continuity.
凍脹差異~Differential frost heave || 凍脹與水分遷移及冰透鏡生長有關，不只是原有孔隙水的體積膨脹。地層約束及補水路徑使地表或既有隧道產生不均勻隆起；結構常由差異變位而非平均抬升量控制，監測因此須跨越凍結區邊界。~Frost heave involves water migration and ice-lens growth, not merely expansion of existing pore water. Ground restraint and water supply cause uneven uplift of the surface or existing tunnels. Structures are often governed by differential movement rather than mean heave, so monitoring must span the boundary of the freezing zone. || 兩點差異抬升Δs=6 mm、間距L=12 m=12000 mm，角變形β=Δs/L=0.0005 rad~For differential heave Δs=6 mm over L=12 m=12000 mm, angular distortion β=Δs/L=0.0005 rad || 用精密水準及隧道收斂測點追蹤凍結區內外差異，將位移方向與水位、溫度歷程比對。~Track differential movement inside and outside the freezing zone with precise levelling and tunnel convergence, comparing directions with water levels and temperature history. || 地表抬升看似均勻時，接縫附近仍可能集中轉角；既有管線的脆性接頭可能先開裂。~Apparently uniform surface heave can still concentrate rotation near joints, allowing brittle connections in existing utilities to crack first. || 凍脹只要總抬升不大就不會損傷周邊結構。~Small total frost heave cannot damage neighbouring structures. || 變形允收需依資產接縫與管線能力制定；凍結區變更前，由資產管理者和設計者確認監測涵蓋範圍。~Set movement criteria from asset-joint and utility capacity; the asset owner and designer confirm monitoring coverage before the freezing zone is changed. || 角變形是兩點平均坡度，不等於構件曲率或接縫開口；若剛體轉動佔主要部分，應與真正畸變分開判讀。~Angular distortion here is a two-point mean slope, not member curvature or joint opening; separate rigid-body rotation where it dominates from actual structural distortion.
冷量備援~Cooling reserve || 冷凍設備停機後，凍土吸收外部熱量並逐步升溫，尚未完全融化前其強度也可能下降。可用熱緩衝取決於最低允許溫度及凍土體積，不能把全部冰融化熱都當可用餘裕；備援還要考慮電力、循環泵及管路共同失效。~After refrigeration stops, frozen ground absorbs heat and warms, potentially losing strength before complete thawing. Useful thermal reserve depends on the allowable temperature and frozen volume; total ice-melting energy is not all usable margin. Backup assessment must also consider common failures of power, circulation pumps and pipework rather than the refrigeration unit alone. || 假設到指定警戒溫度的可用熱緩衝E=3600 MJ、持續熱流P=0.1 MW=0.1 MJ/s，t=E/P=36000 s=10 h~With usable reserve E=3600 MJ to a specified warning temperature and heat inflow P=0.1 MW=0.1 MJ/s, t=E/P=36000 s=10 h || 以熱模型及實測升溫速率交叉估計緩衝，測試獨立電源與警報回路，核對最暖點而非平均溫度。~Cross-check reserve using the thermal model and measured warming rate, test independent power and alarms, and assess the warmest point rather than mean temperature. || 冷凍機有備機但共用供電或循環泵時，單一故障仍可能切斷全部冷量，使局部薄壁先軟化。~A spare refrigeration unit sharing power or circulation pumps can still lose all cooling from one failure, allowing thin local zones to soften first. || 凍土沒有完全融化前，其支護能力都不會改變。~Frozen-ground support capacity remains unchanged until complete thawing. || 備援驗證須涵蓋共因失效及現場可到達時間；停機後的開挖限制由冷凍與地工負責人共同核定。~Backup verification covers common-cause failure and response access time; refrigeration and geotechnical leads jointly define excavation restrictions after outages. || 定熱流估算只提供簡化時間尺度，實際熱流會隨溫差與流場改變；十小時不是可繼續作業的保證或撤離時限。~The constant-heat estimate gives a simplified time scale; heat flow changes with temperature difference and groundwater, so ten hours is neither an operating guarantee nor an evacuation deadline.
融沉預估~Thaw settlement || 解凍後冰透鏡消失，土骨架可能在外荷載下重新壓密，造成與凍脹不對稱的殘餘沉陷。永久襯砌、管線與周邊地基對此變形的剛度不同，荷載會重新分配；凍結期間表現良好並不代表解凍階段已完成驗證。~Thawing removes ice lenses and allows the skeleton to reconsolidate under load, leaving settlement that need not reverse prior heave symmetrically. Permanent lining, utilities and neighbouring foundations have different stiffnesses, causing load redistribution. Good behaviour during freezing therefore does not establish satisfactory performance through the thaw stage. || 假設受影響層厚H=3 m、平均融沉應變εv=0.02，s=εvH=0.06 m=60 mm~For affected thickness H=3 m and mean thaw-settlement strain εv=0.02, s=εvH=0.06 m=60 mm || 用凍融試驗與分層沉陷計檢查殘餘變形，配合孔壓消散曲線，將地表總沉陷分解到受影響土層。~Use freeze-thaw tests and layered settlement instruments to assess residual deformation, combining pore-pressure dissipation with decomposition of surface settlement by affected layer. || 解凍後差異沉陷可能使接縫張開，若監測在冷凍停止時即結束，就會漏掉最重要的永久變形。~Differential thaw settlement may open joints; ending monitoring when refrigeration stops misses the most significant permanent deformation stage. || 凍脹多少，解凍後就必定等量回到原位。~Thawing always reverses frost heave exactly to the original position. || 交接需指定解凍後監測終止條件及資產檢查責任；地工設計者確認孔壓與沉陷趨勢穩定後才核准結案。~Handover specifies post-thaw monitoring closure criteria and asset-inspection responsibility; the geotechnical designer confirms stable pore-pressure and settlement trends before closeout. || 一維應變積分不包含三維拘束與結構互制，融沉應變必須由代表性試驗界定，不能把其他工程的沉陷率直接移用。~One-dimensional strain integration excludes three-dimensional restraint and structural interaction; representative tests must establish thaw strain rather than transferring another project's settlement ratio.
永久襯砌接管~Permanent-lining takeover || 凍土是暫時支護與止水措施，停止冷凍後永久襯砌須獨立承擔設計水壓及土壓。支護接管不能只看混凝土達到抗壓強度，還要確認閉合、接縫水密與抗浮路徑；解凍引起的位移可能同時改變這些界面。~Frozen soil provides temporary support and sealing; after cooling ends, permanent lining must independently resist design water and ground pressures. Takeover requires more than concrete compressive strength: closure, joint sealing and uplift load paths also matter, and thaw-induced displacement can change these interfaces simultaneously. || 假設外部水頭h=15 m、受浮投影面積A=8 m²、γw=9.81 kN/m³，U=γwhA=1177 kN~For external head h=15 m, uplift plan area A=8 m² and γw=9.81 kN/m³, U=γwhA=1177 kN || 核對永久襯砌閉合與止水試驗，將設計水位、抗浮構件及解凍位移聯合審查，不只驗材料強度。~Verify permanent closure and joint tests, reviewing design water level, uplift-resisting members and thaw movement together rather than material strength alone. || 提前停止冷凍可能讓水壓與融沉同時作用於尚未閉合的襯砌，造成滲漏或上浮。~Stopping cooling early can apply water pressure and thaw settlement together to an incomplete lining, causing leakage or uplift. || 永久混凝土強度達標就能立即解除所有冷凍支護。~Meeting permanent concrete strength allows immediate removal of all freezing support. || 冷凍解除必須設正式停留點，地工、襯砌及營運負責人共同簽認荷載接管與後續監測責任。~Ending refrigeration requires a formal hold point jointly released by geotechnical, lining and operations leads, confirming load takeover and subsequent monitoring responsibility. || 水頭乘面積只計該底板的均勻水壓合力，不是整體浮力穩定結論；自重、側向作用及抗拔構件需按同一自由體計算。~Head times area gives a uniform pressure resultant on that slab, not overall uplift stability; self-weight, lateral actions and tension elements require a consistent free-body calculation.
'''),'原創教學例：假設需相變的孔隙水質量m=1000 kg，潛熱Lf=334 kJ/kg，移除潛熱Q=mLf=334000 kJ。若取樣顯示需相變水量增加10%至1100 kg，Q變為367400 kJ，同樣增加10%。這個比較保持潛熱與相變比例固定，只計冰水轉換，不含土粒顯熱、未凍水、鹽分、管路損失或地下水對流。真正冷凍工期需以焓與流動熱輸送模型配合測溫判定，不能把這個能量除以機組額定功率後直接放行開挖。~Original teaching example: assume m=1000 kg of pore water undergoes phase change with latent heat Lf=334 kJ/kg. The latent energy is Q=mLf=334000 kJ. Increasing the water mass by 10% to 1100 kg raises Q to 367400 kJ, also by 10%. This comparison holds latent heat and frozen fraction fixed and covers only ice-water conversion. It excludes soil sensible heat, unfrozen water, salinity, pipe losses and groundwater advection. Actual freezing duration requires an enthalpy and advective-heat model supported by temperatures; dividing this energy by rated plant power does not authorize excavation.',['geo-site','fhwa-ground','crossrail-passages'],['Crossrail聯絡通道：未用凍結的工法比較~Crossrail cross passages: nonfreezing method comparison','詹森礦井：凍結與機械開挖界面比較~Jansen Mine: freezing and mechanical-excavation interface comparison'])

add('b180','穩定液壓差、槽壁滲透與連續壁接頭品質~Slurry pressure balance, trench permeability and diaphragm-wall joints','連續壁成槽時，穩定液必須與地下水、土層滲透性及地面載重共同維持槽壁穩定。本課從壓差與濾餅機理出發，連結槽段幾何、垂直度、沉渣與鋼筋籠浮力，再用混凝土量平衡與接頭水力坡降建立施工品質及鄰房變形的驗證鏈。~During diaphragm-wall excavation, support fluid interacts with groundwater, permeability and surface loading to maintain trench stability. The course connects pressure balance and filter cake to panel geometry, verticality, sediment and cage buoyancy, then uses concrete-volume balance and joint hydraulic gradients to verify construction quality and adjacent-asset movement.',compact(r'''
穩定液壓差~Slurry pressure margin || 穩定液的靜水壓對槽壁施加支承，地下水則從外側抵銷部分壓力，兩者須以同一高程及液面比較。液位突然下降可能使支承消失，密度增加雖可提高壓力，卻也影響沉渣、流動及混凝土置換，不能單獨追求較大數值。~Support-fluid pressure acts on trench walls while external groundwater offsets part of it, requiring comparison at a common elevation and fluid level. A sudden level drop can remove support. Higher density increases pressure but also affects sedimentation, flow and concrete displacement, so maximizing density alone is not a rational criterion. || 假設液面相同、穩定液γs=11 kN/m³、水γw=9.81 kN/m³、深度z=20 m，Δp=(γs−γw)z=23.8 kPa~With equal fluid levels, γs=11 kN/m³, γw=9.81 kN/m³ and z=20 m, Δp=(γs−γw)z=23.8 kPa || 分深度測密度並連續追蹤液位，對照外側水壓計；將液位差與密度差分開帶入壓力圖。~Measure density by depth and continuously track fluid level against external piezometers, separating level and density differences in pressure diagrams. || 穩定液漏失會降低支承壓力，槽口沉陷或局部坍塌可能在平均密度仍合格時發生。~Fluid loss reduces support pressure; collar settlement or local collapse can occur even while average slurry density remains acceptable. || 穩定液密度合格就不需要再監測液面高度。~Acceptable slurry density eliminates the need to monitor fluid level. || 每個槽段應保留液位與密度時間線；異常漏失的停留點由成槽及地工負責人共同確認。~Retain fluid-level and density time histories for every panel; excavation and geotechnical leads jointly confirm hold points for abnormal fluid loss. || 壓差不是完整槽壁安全係數，還須檢查土楔、地面載重及三維拱效應；高滲透地層可能無法形成有效壓力邊界。~Pressure margin is not a complete trench-stability factor; soil wedges, surcharge and three-dimensional arching also matter, and permeable strata may not sustain the intended pressure boundary.
濾餅滲流~Filter-cake seepage || 穩定液在可滲透槽壁形成低滲透濾餅，才可把液壓有效傳給土骨架；若濾餅太薄、破損或無法形成，液體可能深入地層而失去支承效果。濾餅厚度也影響後續混凝土與土體接觸，成槽穩定與接面品質不能分開看。~A low-permeability filter cake allows slurry pressure to act effectively on the soil skeleton. Thin, damaged or absent cake permits fluid penetration and loss of support efficiency. Cake thickness also affects later concrete-ground contact, linking excavation stability with interface quality rather than treating them as unrelated controls. || 假設濾餅k=1×10⁻⁹ m/s、水頭差Δh=10 m、厚度t=0.005 m，達西流速v=kΔh/t=2×10⁻⁶ m/s~For cake permeability k=1×10⁻⁹ m/s, head difference Δh=10 m and thickness t=0.005 m, Darcy flux v=kΔh/t=2×10⁻⁶ m/s || 以濾失與泥皮試驗配合地層粒徑判斷濾餅形成，核對現場液位補充量及漏失位置。~Use fluid-loss and cake tests with soil grading to assess cake formation, checking field replenishment volumes and fluid-loss locations. || 把試驗杯內泥皮表現直接套用於礫石層，可能漏掉大孔隙流失與槽壁局部失穩。~Transferring laboratory filter-cake behaviour directly to gravel may miss large-pore fluid loss and local wall instability. || 穩定液黏度足夠就一定能在任何地層形成濾餅。~Adequate slurry viscosity guarantees a filter cake in every soil. || 穩定液配方試驗需對應代表性地層；漏失機理未辨明前，地工設計者應審查替代支承或預處理方案。~Fluid qualification must represent the ground; before proceeding with unexplained losses, the geotechnical designer reviews alternative support or pretreatment options. || 式中流速是達西通量而非孔隙內真實流速，假設均勻完整濾餅；開裂及粗孔隙穿透不能靠此一維模型表達。~The velocity is Darcy flux rather than pore-water velocity and assumes intact uniform cake; cracking and penetration into coarse voids fall outside this one-dimensional model.
槽段三維效應~Panel three-dimensional effect || 有限槽段的兩端土體可提供三維拱效應，因而槽長與深度會影響穩定，不能把無限長剖面的結果無條件套用。延長槽段可減少接頭數，卻增加開放面與施工時間，也可能穿越更多地層變異，方案取捨需要同時考量。~Soil at the ends of a finite panel provides three-dimensional arching, making stability sensitive to panel length and depth. An infinite-section result cannot be transferred unconditionally. Longer panels reduce joint count but enlarge exposure, prolong excavation and cross more ground variability, so these effects must be considered together. || 假設槽段長L=6 m、深H=30 m，幾何比L/H=0.20~For panel length L=6 m and depth H=30 m, the geometric ratio L/H=0.20 || 對各槽長方案建立相同地層及液壓邊界，核對端部與中段變形；把實際開放時間列入比較。~Compare panel-length options under the same ground and fluid-pressure boundaries, checking end and mid-panel movement and including actual exposure duration. || 長槽段若跨越局部軟弱層，端部拱效應可能不足，槽壁變形與超挖會先集中於中段。~A long panel crossing a weak lens may gain insufficient end restraint, concentrating deformation and overbreak near the middle. || 槽段越長、接頭越少，就必定具有更好的整體安全性。~Longer panels with fewer joints necessarily improve overall safety. || 槽段劃分應與地質剖面及設備能力一併核定；跨越異常地層時，由成槽設計者重審槽長而非照抄標準分段。~Approve panel layout with geology and equipment capability; the excavation designer reassesses length across anomalous ground rather than repeating a standard panel arrangement. || 長深比僅為幾何描述，並無通用允收界限；完整分析仍需土體強度、液壓、地面載重與槽端條件。~The length-depth ratio describes geometry and has no universal acceptance threshold; full analysis still needs soil strength, fluid pressure, surcharge and end conditions.
槽邊載重~Trench-edge surcharge || 吊車、履帶機及材料堆置增加槽邊土體的側向需求，作用不一定均勻，也會隨機具移動而改變。簡化側壓係數可說明均布附加載重的量級，但局部履帶及支腿作用需按距離與接地範圍分析，不能只用全場平均荷重。~Cranes, tracked machinery and stockpiles increase lateral demand near the trench, with nonuniform effects that change as equipment moves. A pressure coefficient illustrates a uniform surcharge scale, but tracks and outriggers require analysis by distance and contact area rather than a site-wide average load. || 假設均布附加載重q=40 kPa、側壓係數K=0.5，增量Δσh=Kq=20 kPa~For uniform surcharge q=40 kPa and lateral coefficient K=0.5, incremental pressure Δσh=Kq=20 kPa || 核對機具位置、接地尺寸及堆料高度，將實際載重位置投影到槽壁分析，不以道路容許載重替代。~Check machine locations, contact dimensions and stockpile heights, projecting actual loads into trench analysis rather than substituting a road-load rating. || 吊車靠近槽邊或支腿反力集中會提高局部側壓，造成地面裂縫與穩定液漏失的連鎖反應。~A crane close to the edge or concentrated outrigger reaction can raise local lateral pressure, initiating ground cracking and subsequent slurry loss. || 地面不沉陷就表示機具載重沒有影響槽壁穩定。~No visible surface settlement means machinery loading does not affect trench stability. || 成槽平面圖需標出載重控制區與機具移位條件；臨時工程設計者核准後才調整吊裝站位。~The excavation plan identifies load-control zones and relocation conditions; the temporary-works designer approves changes before lifting positions move. || 側壓係數須對應土體狀態及允許變形，局部載重還有三維擴散；本式不是吊車站位或支腿操作許可。~The coefficient must match soil state and permitted movement, while local loads spread in three dimensions; this equation does not authorize crane positioning or outrigger operations.
垂直度偏差~Verticality deviation || 連續壁槽孔偏斜會影響壁厚、鋼筋籠淨距與相鄰槽段接合。深度越大，同樣角度或比例偏差形成的底部偏移越大，兩側槽段若朝相反方向偏離，接頭處的有效重疊可能比單段誤差更不利。~Trench deviation affects wall thickness, cage clearance and neighbouring-panel connection. At greater depth, the same inclination produces a larger toe offset. Adjacent panels deviating in opposite directions can reduce effective joint overlap more severely than either panel's individual tolerance suggests. || 深度H=40 m、假設偏斜比i=0.005，底部偏移δ=Hi=0.20 m~For depth H=40 m and assumed inclination ratio i=0.005, toe offset δ=Hi=0.20 m || 用槽壁超音波量測沿深度的輪廓，核對導牆基準與設備姿態，將相鄰槽段放在同一座標比較。~Use ultrasonic trench profiling by depth, check guide-wall datum and equipment attitude, and compare adjacent panels in one coordinate frame. || 偏斜可能使鋼筋籠卡住或接頭形成缺口，後續即使灌足混凝土仍無法恢復原設計連續性。~Deviation can trap the cage or leave a joint gap; placing the specified concrete volume does not restore the intended continuity. || 槽口位置正確就代表整個深槽都在設計位置。~A correctly located trench collar guarantees the full-depth panel position. || 吊放鋼筋籠前應取得全深輪廓驗收；超差位置由壁體設計者核定修正，不以強行下放解決。~Obtain full-depth profile acceptance before cage installation; the wall designer approves correction of deviations rather than resolving them by forced placement. || 此式為固定偏斜的線性估算，真實彎曲孔形須用全深量測；設計接頭能力需採兩槽相對位置，不能只看各自合格率。~This linear estimate assumes constant inclination; a curved trench requires full-depth measurement, and joint performance depends on relative panel positions rather than individual compliance rates.
槽底沉渣~Bottom sediment || 成槽後的懸浮粒子會沉降在槽底，形成低強度、易壓縮的接面，也可能在混凝土置換時夾入壁體。沉渣厚度不是單靠穩定液密度可知，停置時間、粒徑及清底效果均有影響；壁樁承載與止水連續性需分別檢查。~Suspended particles settle after excavation, forming a weak compressible base or becoming trapped during concrete displacement. Slurry density alone does not establish sediment thickness; waiting time, grading and cleaning effectiveness also matter. Bearing performance of barrettes and hydraulic continuity require separate assessment of the resulting interface. || 槽底長L=6 m、寬B=1 m、平均沉渣厚t=0.08 m，V=L B t=0.48 m³~For base length L=6 m, width B=1 m and mean sediment thickness t=0.08 m, V=L B t=0.48 m³ || 在不同槽底位置量測沉渣，並核對清底與澆置間隔；用取樣及混凝土置換紀錄排查夾泥。~Measure sediment at multiple base positions and verify the cleaning-to-placement interval; use sampling and concrete-displacement records to investigate entrapped slurry. || 厚沉渣會造成端部壓縮或局部夾泥，表面混凝土強度合格仍可能留下深部滲漏路徑。~Thick sediment can cause base compression or slurry inclusions; satisfactory surface concrete strength does not exclude a deep leakage path. || 清底完成一次後，多久再澆置都不會重新沉積。~Once the base is cleaned, no sediment can redeposit before concrete placement. || 清底驗收需記錄量測位置與時間；延誤超過核定條件時由監造要求複查，不能只沿用先前合格紀錄。~Record measurement positions and time at base acceptance; delays beyond approved conditions require reinspection rather than reliance on the earlier acceptance record. || 體積式只估算平均沉渣量，局部厚層可能更不利；沉渣允收需依端承、壁體品質及專案規範分別訂定。~The volume expression estimates mean sediment only; local thick pockets can be more adverse, and acceptance depends on bearing, wall quality and project specifications.
鋼筋籠浮力~Cage buoyancy || 鋼筋籠浸入穩定液後，其有效吊重因排開液體而下降，但在混凝土置換時還可能受到黏滯拖曳與上舉作用。空心附件若封閉會增加排水體積，實際浮力不一定只等於鋼筋實體體積；定位系統須辨別重量、浮力與施工擾動。~A cage immersed in slurry has reduced effective suspended weight, but concrete displacement can also create drag and upward force. Closed hollow attachments increase displaced volume, so buoyancy is not necessarily based on steel volume alone. Restraint design must distinguish weight, buoyancy and construction disturbances rather than treating every upward movement as one cause. || 穩定液γs=11 kN/m³、假設總排液體積V=3 m³，浮力B=γsV=33 kN~With support-fluid unit weight γs=11 kN/m³ and total displaced volume V=3 m³, buoyancy B=γsV=33 kN || 核對籠體與附件體積，記錄吊重及籠頂高程，對照澆置速度與液面變化，分辨靜浮力和拖曳。~Check cage and attachment volumes and log suspended load and cage-top elevation against placement rate and fluid levels to distinguish static buoyancy from drag. || 鋼筋籠上浮會改變保護層及接頭鋼筋位置，固定不足可能在混凝土開始凝結後才被發現。~Cage uplift changes cover and connection-bar positions, and inadequate restraint may only become apparent after concrete starts setting. || 鋼筋比穩定液重，所以施工中完全不可能上浮。~Steel is denser than slurry, so the cage cannot rise during construction. || 澆置前由臨時工程負責人核定籠體定位與監測，任何上浮趨勢須依核定停留點處理並保存高程紀錄。~The temporary-works lead approves cage restraint and monitoring before placement; any rising trend is managed under an approved hold point with retained elevation records. || 阿基米德式只給靜浮力，不包括混凝土流動拖曳與卡阻；排液體積需按實際封閉附件及開口狀態計算。~Archimedes' expression gives static buoyancy only, excluding concrete-flow drag and snagging; displaced volume must reflect actual closed attachments and opening conditions.
混凝土量平衡~Concrete volume balance || 混凝土澆置量與理論槽體積的差異，可用於追蹤超挖、漏失或輪廓量測誤差，但過量不是品質良好的證明。澆置上升曲線若局部異常，可能反映槽壁坍落、夾泥或混凝土流入空隙，須與槽形及回收穩定液量共同判讀。~Differences between placed concrete and theoretical trench volume help track overbreak, loss and profiling error, but excess volume does not prove quality. An anomalous rise curve can indicate wall collapse, slurry entrapment or concrete entering voids and must be interpreted with trench shape and recovered-fluid volume. || 理論體積Vt=180 m³、實際投入Va=210 m³，超量率(Va−Vt)/Vt=16.7%~For theoretical volume Vt=180 m³ and placed volume Va=210 m³, excess ratio (Va−Vt)/Vt=16.7% || 將每車方量、澆置時間與混凝土面標高形成曲線，對照超音波槽形及液體回收量，標出突變深度。~Plot batch volume, placement time and concrete elevation, compare with ultrasonic trench profile and recovered-fluid volume, and identify depths where the trend changes. || 只看總方量足夠可能掩蓋局部夾泥，過量混凝土也可能代表槽壁坍塌而非有效增加壁厚。~Adequate total volume can conceal local slurry inclusions; excess concrete may indicate wall collapse rather than useful additional wall thickness. || 混凝土用量超過理論值就代表連續壁一定更強。~Concrete volume above theory necessarily produces a stronger diaphragm wall. || 量平衡異常須與地質及澆置事件一起審查；壁體設計者決定補充檢測範圍，不以單一超量率放行。~Review abnormal balance together with geology and placement events; the wall designer defines supplementary investigation rather than releasing work from one excess ratio. || 此比值不區分超挖、損失及量測誤差，也沒有通用合格範圍；驗收還需材料、幾何與完整性等獨立證據。~The ratio does not distinguish overbreak, loss and measurement error and has no universal pass range; acceptance also requires independent material, geometry and integrity evidence.
接頭水力坡降~Joint hydraulic gradient || 相鄰連續壁槽段的接頭是幾何、混凝土品質及止水構件共同形成的薄弱界面。外內水頭差沿很短的缺口集中時，局部坡降會很高，可能引發滲流帶砂；因此完工水密不是只靠壁體本身的滲透係數來判斷。~Panel joints are interfaces governed jointly by geometry, concrete quality and sealing components. A head difference concentrated across a short defect creates a high local gradient and may transport soil. Completed-wall sealing therefore cannot be established solely from the permeability of the concrete away from its joints. || 假設水頭差Δh=10 m、有效滲流路長L=0.5 m，水力坡降i=Δh/L=20，無因次~For head difference Δh=10 m and effective seepage length L=0.5 m, hydraulic gradient i=Δh/L=20, dimensionless || 分槽段記錄水壓與出水混濁度，將接頭位置、實際偏斜及止水構件紀錄疊合，追查短路徑。~Record pressure and turbidity by panel, overlay joint positions, actual deviation and waterstop records, and investigate short seepage paths. || 接頭缺口可導致帶砂滲流與周邊沉陷；內表面止漏若未查明水路，可能只把流量轉移到鄰近界面。~A joint defect can cause sediment-carrying leakage and adjacent settlement; surface sealing without tracing the water path may merely divert flow to a neighbouring interface. || 連續壁混凝土本體抗滲合格，就代表每個接頭水密。~Impermeable wall concrete guarantees every panel joint is watertight. || 接頭缺陷處理需由地工及結構設計者共同核准，監測應持續涵蓋外水頭與周邊沉陷，不能只記室內漏水量。~Geotechnical and structural designers jointly approve joint repair; monitoring must retain external heads and adjacent settlement rather than indoor leakage alone. || 坡降不是流量，仍需滲透性及路徑面積才能估算出水；局部集中流與侵蝕可能使達西均質模型失效。~Gradient is not flow rate; permeability and path area are still required, and concentrated flow or erosion may invalidate a homogeneous Darcy model.
鄰房角變形~Adjacent-building distortion || 深開挖壁體變形與地層流失可傳到鄰房，使基礎產生差異沉陷。結構反應與基礎型式、跨距及既有裂縫相關，不能用總沉陷一項代表損傷風險；角變形可作初步指標，但需扣除整體剛體傾斜並關注局部曲率。~Wall movement and ground loss can transmit to neighbouring foundations as differential settlement. Structural response depends on foundation type, span and existing cracking, so total settlement alone does not describe damage potential. Angular distortion is an initial indicator, but rigid-body tilt must be separated and local curvature considered. || 兩測點差異沉陷Δs=4 mm、距離L=8 m=8000 mm，β=Δs/L=0.0005 rad~For differential settlement Δs=4 mm over L=8 m=8000 mm, β=Δs/L=0.0005 rad || 施工前建立建物裂縫與高程基準，將精密水準、傾度及壁體位移聯合比對，檢查測點是否隨建物整體轉動。~Establish preconstruction crack and elevation baselines, jointly compare precise levelling, tilt and wall movement, and determine whether points follow rigid-body building rotation. || 若只以平均沉陷管理，局部基礎差異可能先造成梁柱裂縫；基準點受影響也會掩蓋真實變形。~Managing only mean settlement can miss differential foundation movement that cracks members first; an affected survey reference can also conceal actual deformation. || 建物總沉陷很小就能保證任何接縫與構件都不受損。~Small total building settlement guarantees no damage to joints or members. || 警戒值應由建物評估者依資產能力訂定；監測異常由開挖及建物設計專業共同判讀，並保留原始讀值。~The building assessor sets triggers from asset capacity; excavation and building specialists interpret anomalies jointly while preserving the original measurements. || 此兩點斜率不是通用損傷界限，也不能區分平移與彎曲；應增加測點、溫度修正及結構模型來辨識真實變形模式。~This two-point slope is not a universal damage limit and cannot distinguish translation from bending; additional points, temperature corrections and structural modelling identify the real deformation mode.
'''),'原創教學例：假設穩定液與地下水液面相同，單位重分別為11與9.81 kN/m³，在深度20 m的靜水壓差為Δp=(11−9.81)×20=23.8 kPa。保持液位與密度條件不變，若檢查深度增加10%至22 m，壓差增為26.18 kPa。這只增加液壓差，不代表整體槽壁安全也增加10%，因為土壓、地層變化及槽段幾何同步影響穩定。應把液位實測、濾餅形成及槽邊載重納入完整分析，再由成槽設計者確認可接受的施工條件。~Original teaching example: assume equal slurry and groundwater levels with unit weights of 11 and 9.81 kN/m³. At 20 m depth the static pressure margin is Δp=(11−9.81)×20=23.8 kPa. Holding levels and densities fixed while increasing depth by 10% to 22 m gives 26.18 kPa. This increases hydraulic margin only, not overall trench stability by 10%, because earth pressures, changing strata and panel geometry also influence the mechanism. Include observed fluid levels, filter-cake formation and edge surcharge in the complete analysis before the excavation designer confirms acceptable site-specific construction conditions.',['keller-diaphragm','geo-wall','geo-site','fhwa-ground'],['Crossrail深車站：擋土系統比較~Crossrail deep stations: retaining-system comparison','赤柱岩洞：開挖方式對照~Stanley caverns: contrasting excavation method'])
if __name__=='__main__': write()
